 anyone seeking exceptional products and customer service!","time":1727707060,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Klim Nikolaev","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100604896084316994440/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWsKYK0sgzyAcsI-jjhEjWShz1CNH8lTcPKpGs8wETGIczgr8Os=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"4 months ago","text":"Great place with a wide selection and high-quality products. The staff is very polite and always ready to help, explain the differences between the products, and find exactly what suits you. The atmosphere in the shop is pleasant and relaxing, and the prices are quite reasonable. I was very satisfied with my visit and will definitely come back. I highly recommend it to anyone looking for quality products and excellent service!","time":1727018854,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Conor Murray","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112318186747899841173/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL7c92OyggHXYKVE4O0n8uNojRRS9RnGbmmPZ7fhbAtadlwjA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"a month ago","text":"Fantastic dispensary in Chiang Mai, they were super helpful with choosing the strain i wanted and even rolled it for me. Definitely recommend this shop if you’re in Chiang Mai and staying on the northside of the old town","time":1734172009,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Peter Paulus","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112296736918089971366/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIXa_N4bqcAV2yDmEuhXRomaDEtxtf6YAN8OAl4pF8ag_Sfcl8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"a week ago","text":"Awesome cannabis dispensary for the smoker actually looking for TERPS you can taste.\nThe price for their quality is fair. All buds translate from smell to taste properly. The product is also stored properly in a cooler. Most dispos don't really care about storing properly, here you can see why they should!\nHad a great time! Recommended!","time":1738049946,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Slava Rybin","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100777931854780028394/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWw78haKO0PqjLjxs0xkZHQ-W6zThGokuACtmeyx7Ghues8TTNKAQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"4 months ago","text":"Extremely cozy weedspace with the best-looking high-quality flowers priced so well 😍 Staff is very nice 🙏","time":1727018858,"translated":false}],"reviews_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/place/?q=place_id:ChIJr5OFx4A72jARfbXW98qGxP0"},{"place_id":"ChIJR1_HFQA72jARNXFqIuTqj0s","name":"Saneha Ganja Cannabis shop","address":"9 4 Phra Pok Klao Rd Soi 4, Tambon Phra Sing, Amphoe Mueang Chiang Mai, Chang Wat Chiang Mai 50200, Thailand","phone_number":"082 496 4228","geometry":{"location":{"lat":18.7832505,"lng":98.9871977},"viewport":{"northeast":{"lat":18.7846185802915,"lng":98.9885449302915},"southwest":{"lat":18.7819206197085,"lng":98.98584696970849}}},"opening_hours":{"open_now":false,"periods":[{"close":{"day":1,"time":"0000"},"open":{"day":0,"time":"1100"}},{"close":{"day":2,"time":"0000"},"open":{"day":1,"time":"1100"}},{"close":{"day":3,"time":"0000"},"open":{"day":2,"time":"1100"}},{"close":{"day":4,"time":"0000"},"open":{"day":3,"time":"1100"}},{"close":{"day":5,"time":"0000"},"open":{"day":4,"time":"1100"}},{"close":{"day":6,"time":"0000"},"open":{"day":5,"time":"1100"}},{"close":{"day":0,"time":"0000"},"open":{"day":6,"time":"1100"}}],"weekday_text":["Monday: 11:00 AM – 12:00 AM","Tuesday: 11:00 AM – 12:00 AM","Wednesday: 11:00 AM – 12:00 AM","Thursday: 11:00 AM – 12:00 AM","Friday: 11:00 AM – 12:00 AM","Saturday: 11:00 AM – 12: